From 9e04f3e64982071c24a214cc7c7d39b860cca085 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RitzDaCat <49771174+RitzDaCat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 23:20:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: bound and reuse stable color work

Stable fullscreen and composited frames repeatedly rebuild identical color
pipelines, allocate equivalent HDR metadata descriptions, copy the plane
pipeline list and upload unchanged OpenGL color uniforms.

Keep immutable last-value state per output and shader, use a fixed four-entry
renderer identity cache, and return the DRM pipeline list by const reference.
For the composited path, hoist destination reciprocals and the invariant tone
mapping coefficient to CPU setup, and specialize shaders for surfaces proven
opaque so premultiplication divisions are compiled out.

All caches are bounded and owner-local. They add no locks, maps, configuration
or telemetry, and their keys include every input that affects the result.
